        <mxCell id="111" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;(*) Risk classification will be evaluated for reporting purposes only and will not influence the decision-making process; therefore, this step will be excluded from the workflow.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;div&gt;(**) Risk classification and Lexis Nexis report will be generated before Rule Engine Step&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;(***) Risk classification regarding Emailage module will be applicable for both Personal Email and Business Email&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="2">
